Procedure separation is normalized, not additive: butted procedures gain
one blank line, and a three-blank-line gap shrinks to one
(fmt.blank_lines_between_procs default 1, issue #33).
-- input.ssl --
:PROCEDURE First;
:RETURN 1;
:ENDPROC;
:PROCEDURE Second;
:RETURN 2;
:ENDPROC;



:PROCEDURE Third;
:RETURN 3;
:ENDPROC;
-- format --
:PROCEDURE First;
	:RETURN 1;
:ENDPROC;

:PROCEDURE Second;
	:RETURN 2;
:ENDPROC;

:PROCEDURE Third;
	:RETURN 3;
:ENDPROC;
-- diagnostics --
-- diagnostics [--strict --info] --
